  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/1"/>The [correct offerings to God,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/2"/>a broken spirit,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/3"/>a broken and humbled heart;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/4"/>God, You will not despise.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/5"/>You will grant truth to Jacob,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/6"/>kindliness to Abraham,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/7"/>as You have sworn to our fathers
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/8"/>from the days of old.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/9"/>And the kindliness of Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/10"/>is forever and ever
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/11"/>upon those who fear Him,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/12"/>and His righteousness
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/13"/>upon children’s children.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/14"/>Adonoy is near to the broken-hearted;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:zivchei_elohim_rucha_nishbarah/15"/>and those crushed in spirit, He delivers.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
